#
# List of commands that are documented in a manual with a different name.
# Used by default manual-not-found hook when there is no dir entry for this
# manual, e.g. "info ls" when the coreutils manual is not installed.

# Note that a manual isn't displayed unless it is also listed in
# gnu-manuals-locations.dat. 

ls		coreutils
cd		bash
